              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wuxuu ka hadlay geedaha, intuu ka bilaabay Kedarka Lubnaan ku yaal, ilaa uu gaadhay husobka derbiga ka soo baxa; oo dugaaggana wuu ka hadlay, iyo haadka, iyo waxyaalaha gurguurta, iyo kalluunka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
